Error [E1105]: `#Layout(packed)` is reserved and not yet supported
  --> tests/ui/layout_unsupported_variant.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | #Layout(packed)
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: The supported variants are `c`, `columnar`, and `c, align(N)` or `c, align(target, N)`
 Fix: Use `#Layout(c)`, `#Layout(c, align(64))`, `#Layout(c, align(target, 2097152))`, or `#Layout(columnar)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1105
